<http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#hasSecondaryPurpose> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies additional purposes of a trajectory that are not the main driver of movement."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#hasSecondaryPurpose> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#hasSecondaryPurpose> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has secondary purpose"@en .
